      <uighur>idebkilekü</uighur>
      <cyrillic>идэвхийлэх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>IDEBKILE-</transcript>
      <definition>v.i. To put in effort, exert oneself; to act energetically, work with zest, work deftly or energetically.</definition>
      <page>399</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠢᠳᠠᠪᠺᠢᠯᠠᠨ</unicode>
          <transcript>--n </transcript>
          <definition>Actively, energetically, strenuously</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠢᠳᠠᠪᠺᠢᠯᠠᠨ ᠲᠠᠭᠤᠯᠢᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>--n taγulixu</transcript>
          <definition> To attack swiftly, fall upon (an enemy).</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠢᠳᠠᠪᠺᠢᠯᠠᠨ ᠬᠠᠮᠠᠭᠠᠯᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>--n xamaγalaxu</transcript>
          <definition> To protect zealously.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
